# sweep: --bare
# A reader with no network: puzzles cannot download, and an account key
# typed on the reader is kept but cannot be checked.
expect Play the computer
scenario offline
tap Puzzles
wait-for Download 32 puzzles
expect No puzzles yet. Download a set to solve them offline.
expect-missing Resume puzzle
tap Download 32 puzzles
wait-for This reader is not on a network. Join Wi-Fi and try again.
expect Download 32 puzzles
expect-missing Downloading
clean
shot puzzles-offline
tap Back
wait-for Play the computer
# Playing the computer needs no network.
tap-id play-computer
wait-for Start game
tap-id computer-side-white
tap-id start-computer
wait-for White · Your move
tap Back
wait-for Resume your game
tap-id play
wait-for Connect Lichess
tap Connect Lichess
wait-for Account key
# The computer route names the command to run there.
tap Use computer
wait-for kobo secret set lichess
expect Check again
clean
shot connect-computer
tap Back
wait-for Account key
# Typing the key: it is hidden as a count until Show is tapped.
tap Enter account key
wait-for Save
type lip
expect 3 characters entered
expect-missing lip
clean
shot connect-typing
tap Show
expect lip
tap Save
# Saved, the key is checked, and offline the check says why it failed.
wait-for This reader is not on a network. Join Wi-Fi and try again.
expect Your games
expect Challenge player
expect Refresh
expect-missing Connect Lichess
clean
shot account-offline
tap Back
wait-for Resume your game
tap-id play-online
wait-for Account error
tap-id seek-10-0
wait-idle
wait-for Account error
# Once the check has failed, the screen says so rather than still asking
# the owner to wait for Ready.
expect-missing Tap a time again when the top line says Ready.
clean
shot seek-offline
